            "heading": "Public Key Infrastructure (PKI) & X.509 Certificate Chains",
            "text": "PKI manages digital certificates. A Certificate Authority (CA) signs public keys, binding identities to keys. Browsers validate trust chains from an intermediate CA up to a trusted Root CA embedded in the operating system root trust store.",
