            "heading": "Command and Control (C2) Architectures & Domain Fronting",
            "text": "Command and Control (C2) frameworks (Cobalt Strike, Mythic) provide remote tasking. Adversaries conceal C2 traffic using Domain Fronting (hiding true destinations behind legitimate CDNs over HTTPS) and DNS tunneling to bypass edge egress filters.",
