            "heading": "Static vs Dynamic Malware Analysis (Sandboxing)",
            "text": "Static analysis examines malware binaries without executing them (file headers, strings, disassembly, imports). Dynamic analysis executes malware in an instrumented sandbox (Cuckoo, CAPE) to monitor behavior, process spawning, file changes, and network calls.",
