            "heading": "Switched Traffic Interception: SPAN & Tap Architecture",
            "text": "To monitor switched networks without poisoning ARP tables, engineers configure SPAN (Switched Port Analyzer / Port Mirroring) on switches or install hardware Test Access Points (TAPs) that copy raw electrical signals directly to forensic appliances.",
