            "heading": "Secure TLS Configuration & Cipher Suite Hardening",
            "text": "Web servers must disable legacy SSLv2, SSLv3, TLS 1.0, and TLS 1.1, while supporting only TLS 1.2 and TLS 1.3 with secure forward-secret cipher suites (ECDHE-ECDSA-AES256-GCM-SHA384). Weak ciphers (RC4, 3DES) must be purged.",
