            "heading": "In-Band SQLi: UNION-Based & Error-Based Exploitation",
            "text": "In-band SQLi uses the same channel to inject and view results: UNION-based injection merges query results with database tables; Error-based injection deliberately triggers syntax errors that reflect database version or data inside error strings.",
