            "heading": "Blind SQLi: Boolean-Based vs Time-Based Vectors",
            "text": "When applications suppress errors and data output, Blind SQLi extracts data: Boolean-based infers true/false conditions by observing page differences; Time-based forces database delays (e.g., SLEEP(5)) when conditions evaluate to true.",
