            "heading": "The Bell-LaPadula Confidentiality Model",
            "text": "Bell-LaPadula enforces state machine Confidentiality via multi-level security: Simple Security Property (No Read Up: subjects cannot read higher classifications) and *-Property (Star Property: No Write Down: subjects cannot write data to lower classifications).",
            "codeSnippet": "cat /etc/security/blp_rules.txt",
            "terminalOutput": "RULE 1: Simple Security -> No Read Up (Confidentiality)\nRULE 2: *-Property -> No Write Down (Prevent Data Leakage)",
