            "heading": "Static Application Security Testing (SAST) Mechanics",
            "text": "SAST analyzes source code without executing the program, modeling data flow and abstract syntax trees (AST) to identify unvalidated inputs flowing from Sources (e.g., request.getParameter) to Sinks (e.g., statement.executeQuery).",
            "codeSnippet": "semgrep --config 'p/owasp-top-ten' src/",
