            "heading": "Interactive Application Security Testing (IAST) Hybrid Analysis",
            "text": "IAST combines SAST and DAST by embedding instrumentation agents inside the application runtime server (JVM, .NET, Node.js). As functional tests run, the agent monitors internal memory execution and data flow, producing high-accuracy, low-false-positive alerts.",
