            "heading": "Dependency Confusion & Typosquatting Attack Vectors",
            "text": "In Typosquatting, attackers publish malicious packages with names visually similar to popular libraries (e.g., 'reqeusts' instead of 'requests'). In Dependency Confusion, attackers publish public packages matching internal private corporate package names with higher version numbers.",
